   "en": "County nighttime temperature, 18:00 to midnight, averaged through 2024, in five bands from 20.51 to 27.26 degrees, blue to red. The white proportional circles are the rice yield trend at each station over 2005 to 2024, from minus 0.044 to plus 0.058 tonnes per hectare per year. The hottest counties are in the north and the south. It supports the opening claim that warm nights, not just hot days, are what is eroding rice yield in Taiwan.",
   "zh": "底色是各縣市 2024 年全年平均的夜間溫度（18:00 到午夜），分成 20.51 到 27.26 度五個級距，由藍到紅。白色的比例圓圈是各測站 2005 到 2024 年的稻作產量趨勢，從每年每公頃 −0.044 到 +0.058 公噸。最熱的縣市分布在北部與南部。它支持的是開場的那個主張：侵蝕台灣稻作產量的是暖夜，不只是熱天。"
